Can you look at this readme? 

https://github.com/rugbyprof/3013-Algorithms/blob/master/Assignments/README.md 

It's an example of a README.md that gets built in all of my course folders (e.g Assignments,Lectures,Resources,Worksheets) that gets updated with an old script I wrote that I would like revamped and simplified with your help. 

Here is an example file tree that each of my course repos contains. Notice each major folder (Assignments, Lectures, etc) contains a folder for each "item" (assignment, lecture, etc), and each subfolder contains it's own README.md that we pull info from to regenerate the major folders README adding new assignments or lectures and linking to them.

```txt
